|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| (a) Obtaining designation as a license examination exemption education institution by fraud or other improper means | Article 10 (1) 1 of the Act | Revocation of designation | | | |
| (b) A license examination exemption education institution submits false education completion results to the Commissioner of the Korea Coast Guard, thereby causing a person who has not completed the education under Article 9 (1) 5 of the Act to be exempted from all license examination subjects | Article 10 (1) 2 of the Act | Suspension of services for 6 months | Revocation of designation | | |
| (c) Failure to comply with the educational content under Article 9 (3) of the Act | Article 10 (1) 3 of the Act | Suspension of services for 1 month | Suspension of services for 3 months | Suspension of services for 6 months | Revocation of designation |
| (d) Ceasing to meet the designation standards for license examination exemption education institutions under Article 9 (4) of the Act | Article 10 (1) 4 of the Act | Suspension of services for 1 month | Suspension of services for 3 months | Suspension of services for 6 months | Revocation of designation |

